## Record: Coordinates

### Summary

Where a location is on the map.

### Schema

```schema
latitude: number required min(-90) max(90)
longitude: number required min(-180) max(180)
```

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/locations/locations.types.ts#LocationCoordinates` — as: model
- provenance: inferred

## Record: LocationAttributes

### Summary

What a location keeps beside its details: its coordinates, its email address, its hatching pattern, a venue's room plans, and a stadium's or hall's configured attribute values.

### Schema

```schema
coordinates: part(juicebar.locations#Coordinates)
email: string
hatching_pattern: integer min(0) max(12)
roomPlans: list(juicebar.locations#RoomPlan)
```

### Constraints

- A stadium or a hall also keeps the value of each attribute field the `juicecommerce:location:attribute` configuration gives its kind, under the field's `property`.
- `hatching_pattern` 0 is no pattern.

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/locations/locations.types.ts#LocationAttributes` — as: model
- provenance: inferred

## Record: Country

### Summary

A country of the locations service's list.

### Schema

```schema
id: string required unique
code: string required
name: map(string)
callingCode: string
```

### Constraints

- The backend fills the list with the countries' English names (`en_GB`); a project may add names in other languages.

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/locations/locations.types.ts#LocationCountry` — as: model
- provenance: inferred

## Record: LocationType

### Summary

A type of location, from the `location:type` configuration.

### Schema

```schema
value: string required unique
name: string
localised_name: map(string)
permissions: list(string)
```

### Constraints

- `permissions` are names of permissions on `locations:role`; a type without them is offered to every staff member of the module.
- The module gives the types `web`, `venue`, `region`, `stadion` and `hall` their own behaviour.

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/locations/locations.types.ts#LocationType` — as: model
- provenance: inferred

## Record: LocationCategory

### Summary

A category of location, from the `location:category` configuration.

### Schema

```schema
value: string required unique
name: string
localised_name: map(string)
