## Record: RoomPlan

### Summary

A room plan of the project's room plans module, as far as a venue's seating layout shows it. It is kept by the room plans service, outside this model.

### Schema

```schema
id: string required unique
name: map(string)
media: list(part(juicebar.core#Media))
```

### Constraints

- Some room plans keep their name as one text instead of one per language.

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/locations/details/seating-layout/room-plans.ts#RoomPlan` — as: model
- provenance: inferred

## Capability: Geocoding

### Summary

An address search that gives the coordinates of a street in a city and a country.

### Operations

- `CoordinatesOf(street, city, country) -> coordinates`

### Bindings

- binds: `https://geocode.arcgis.com/arcgis/rest/services/World/GeocodeServer/find` — as: CoordinatesOf
- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/locations/geocoding.service.ts#GeocodingService.coordinatesOf` — as: component
- provenance: inferred

## Capability: RoomPlans

### Summary

The project's room plans: found by a name search, and read one by one.

### Operations

- `FindRoomPlans(term, language) -> roomPlans`
- `GetRoomPlan(roomPlanId) -> roomPlan`

### Bindings

- binds: `service:room-plan#fetch` — as: FindRoomPlans
- binds: `service:room-plan#getRoomPlan` — as: GetRoomPlan
- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/locations/details/seating-layout/room-plans.ts#searchRoomPlans` — as: component
- provenance: inferred

## Capability: LocationUsage

### Summary

Tells whether a location may be deleted, or why not: what in the project still uses it. A project's backend answers it; Quality Circle's refuses while an open training or a shift uses the location.

### Operations

- `CheckDelete(location) -> allowed or reason`

### Bindings

- binds: `service:locations:service:middleware:qc#preDeleteLocation` — as: CheckDelete
- provenance: inferred

